          "title": "You'll want to know: باهوش",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "باهوش (bâhush) — \"clever, intelligent\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "دخترشان خیلی باهوش است. dokhtarashân kheyli bâhush ast. Their daughter is very clever."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "bâ 'with' + hush 'intelligence, wits'. The opposite in speech is kamhush."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "bâhush is built on native Persian bâ, 'with', and hush, 'wits', which is usually traced to Middle Persian hōš. EtymDB has no entry for it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
